        <Function test_a_draft_is_still_refused_however_its_url_is_spelled[/sites/default/files/BROP/DRAFT_2027_Budget_Review_and_Outlook_Paper.pdf]>
        <Function test_the_old_matching_cannot_see_the_2026_paper>
          Positive control: the separator-insensitive match is what finds it.
        <Function test_the_default_matching_is_unchanged_for_other_callers>
          fiscal_summary matches "/budget%20books/" literally.
