        <Function test_a_pending_audit_contributes_nothing>
          "pending" is not an opinion — it must not score as one.
      <Class TestAbsence>
        <Function test_a_county_with_no_budget_data_has_no_score>
          It used to score 0.0, which graded it a C.
        <Function test_a_zero_budget_has_no_score_either>
        <Function test_one_component_is_not_a_composite>
          Exactly the failure being fixed: a "composite" of one input.
        <Function test_two_components_are_enough>
