      <Function test_app_engine_loads_psycopg2[postgres://u:p%40ss@127.0.0.1:1/db?sslmode=disable&connect_timeout=3]>
        ``import database`` is what the seed and validate steps do first.
      <Function test_app_engine_loads_psycopg2[postgresql+psycopg2://u:p%40ss@127.0.0.1:1/db?sslmode=disable&connect_timeout=3]>
